==Battleground==
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 1.33~4.67 seconds<sup>40f~140f</sup>.
*5 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 56.67~60 seconds<sup>1,700f~1,800f</sup>.
*3 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 80~83.33 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Diabrollow]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*3 [[Bore Jr.|Bore Jrs]] spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 100~103.33 seconds<sup>3,000f~3,100f</sup>.
*1 [[King Wahwah]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Midnite D.|Midnite Ds]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 93.33~96.67 seconds<sup>2,800f~2,900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 8~12 seconds<sup>240f~360f</sup>.
*3 [[Diabrollow]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 73.33~76.67 seconds<sup>2,200f~2,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The combination of King Wahwah and Midnite D can be tricky to handle, though the limited number of other supports such as Sir Rel, Bore Jr and Diabrollow means that Midnite D goes extended amounts of time exposed to your [[Paperboy Cat (Rare Cat)|Paperboy Cats]], [[Awakened Bahamut Cat|Awakened Bahamut]] or [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril.]] Teacher Bear, despite hitting hard, has too little HP for this point of the game and serves primarily as cash bags for your units. Bring your best answers to Midnite D, as well as something to deal with the periodic Bore Jr spawns like [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Awakened Doron]] or [[Bullet Train Cat]], and the stage should be smooth sailing.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
* [[Baby Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Cats in the Stroller]]: Their lack of knockback immunity may result in them occasionally being interrupted; however, they're still a solid choice for this stage, as their attacks both pierce, often being able to hit Wahwah, and do a large amount of damage.
* [[Maeda Keiji (Uber Rare Cat)|Immortal Keiji]]: Wave immunity, high bulk and damage, as well as solid spammability make him a good choice for this stage.
* [[D'arktanyan (Uber Rare Cat)|Valiant D'arktanyan]]: Having massive damage against traitless enemies as well as wave immunity allows him to destroy this stage. However, he is still vulnerable to curse, so protect him well.

==Trivia==
*The Navel of the Cat is a reference to the sandstone monolith [[wikipedia:Uluru|Uluru]], which is also known as the "navel of the world" or "navel of the Earth". Uluru is a landmark of Australia, the theme of [[New Horizon]].

